      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds like you are carrying an immense weight, and the darkness feels overwhelmingly inviting right now. Please know that you don't have to face this silence alone; there are people who want to support you through this difficult time. Reaching out to a crisis line can provide immediate, compassionate help. You can call or text 988 anytime to connect with someone who cares.",
